WEBVTT

01:35.860 --> 01:38.270
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.460 --> 01:41.270
[Episode 18]

01:45.500 --> 01:48.160
What is your relationship
with Professor Zhao?

01:50.390 --> 01:52.720
It's a professor-student relationship.

01:52.759 --> 01:54.360
You're stating the obvious!

01:55.130 --> 01:56.280
I didn't call you here

01:56.280 --> 01:58.120
to watch me get beaten up.

01:58.750 --> 01:59.860
Can you just let me make things clear?

01:59.860 --> 02:01.480
This won't solve anything.

02:01.740 --> 02:03.730
Who do you think you are?

02:04.550 --> 02:07.610
You just stood there taking pictures
instead of helping me.

02:07.610 --> 02:09.530
If these photos aren't good enough,

02:09.530 --> 02:10.770
don't bother coming in tomorrow.

02:10.770 --> 02:11.280
Oh.

02:11.740 --> 02:13.200
Mr. Ma, please take a look.

02:25.110 --> 02:26.460
Terrible shot!

02:26.480 --> 02:27.210
Not this one.

02:27.230 --> 02:28.060
There are more.

02:28.060 --> 02:29.220
Keep flipping.

02:38.670 --> 02:40.000
Send this one to me.

02:42.400 --> 02:44.260
I'll send it to you when I get back.

02:45.600 --> 02:46.410
Mr. Ma,

02:47.140 --> 02:50.420
should I step in
if you get beaten up again?

02:52.250 --> 02:53.280
Of course!

02:54.060 --> 02:55.620
If we run into this again,

02:55.640 --> 02:57.270
you step up first.

02:58.130 --> 02:58.750
Okay.

02:59.960 --> 03:01.470
Your composition

03:01.490 --> 03:02.560
is pretty good.

03:05.020 --> 03:06.370
Call me Ma from now on.

03:08.230 --> 03:09.830
Are you free tomorrow night?

03:10.380 --> 03:11.620
I have no plans yet.

03:13.770 --> 03:15.570
There is an interview tomorrow.

03:15.610 --> 03:16.540
You come with me.

03:16.900 --> 03:18.700
I'll send you the address later.

03:19.100 --> 03:19.670
Okay.

03:19.770 --> 03:20.770
Thank you, Mr. Ma.

03:21.900 --> 03:22.750
Thank you, Ma.

03:55.520 --> 03:58.240
Xiaole, we've made up with Chen Zhihan.

03:58.260 --> 04:00.320
See you at the sports ground tonight.

04:23.240 --> 04:24.080
So,

04:25.150 --> 04:26.270
how was your year

04:26.410 --> 04:26.890
abroad?

04:27.040 --> 04:28.170
Just so-so.

04:29.540 --> 04:31.980
We had exams every single month.

04:32.200 --> 04:33.610
I always came in last.

04:34.940 --> 04:35.940
Last?

04:36.130 --> 04:36.810
Seriously?

04:36.840 --> 04:38.640
I remember you were pretty good.

04:38.790 --> 04:40.150
I am pretty good,

04:40.570 --> 04:42.230
but everyone else is good too.

04:42.750 --> 04:45.020
At first I practiced 3 hours a day.

04:45.040 --> 04:46.610
Then 5 hours.

04:46.840 --> 04:47.550
In the end,

04:48.070 --> 04:50.400
I practically lived in the practice room.

04:51.900 --> 04:52.590
That

04:52.610 --> 04:53.810
must have been tough.

05:01.680 --> 05:02.510
How about you?

05:04.210 --> 05:05.020
I...

05:07.050 --> 05:07.850
Same old.

05:09.170 --> 05:10.630
What does "same old" mean?

05:11.790 --> 05:12.790
You know,

05:13.560 --> 05:15.840
just fixing instruments, going to work,

05:16.150 --> 05:17.150
running the shop,

05:18.010 --> 05:19.270
and teaching lessons.

05:20.530 --> 05:22.930
I don't really like the life
I'm living now.

05:23.210 --> 05:26.140
I don't want
to teach at a university forever either.

05:27.110 --> 05:30.310
I'm applying to be the principal cellist
of an orchestra.

05:30.530 --> 05:31.410
If I succeed,

05:32.840 --> 05:35.300
I'll be able
to travel and perform with them.

05:47.090 --> 05:47.550
Come on.

05:47.770 --> 05:48.630
Please come in.

05:49.450 --> 05:51.010
How's the sunset?

05:51.770 --> 05:52.570
Beautiful.

05:52.650 --> 05:53.530
In the future,

05:53.720 --> 05:56.280
we'll put a small sofa right here.

05:56.280 --> 05:57.260
We'll sit here,

05:57.450 --> 05:59.700
basking in the sunlight.

05:59.730 --> 06:00.980
And right here,

06:01.090 --> 06:03.890
we've got to have a vinyl record player.

06:03.890 --> 06:04.970
Just imagine, every night,

06:04.970 --> 06:06.170
after we have dinner,

06:06.210 --> 06:07.970
we'll put on some music,

06:07.970 --> 06:10.390
have a drink,

06:10.530 --> 06:12.530
and dance a little.

06:18.090 --> 06:18.720
What do you think?

06:18.720 --> 06:19.450
Sounds good.

06:19.660 --> 06:20.490
Satisfied?

06:20.890 --> 06:21.550
Satisfied.

06:21.970 --> 06:23.500
Good, that's what matters.

06:24.330 --> 06:24.930
By the way,

06:25.660 --> 06:27.190
I have good news for you too.

06:27.530 --> 06:28.330
Just say it.

06:28.450 --> 06:29.890
Whatever hopes you have for the future,

06:29.890 --> 06:31.150
I'll fulfill them all.

06:31.970 --> 06:33.890
My application to study abroad

06:33.890 --> 06:34.970
got accepted.

06:36.720 --> 06:37.770
That's good.

06:38.450 --> 06:41.090
I'll go check the bathroom.
It seems the...

06:41.330 --> 06:42.060
drainage...

06:42.210 --> 06:43.090
What's wrong?

06:48.210 --> 06:49.120
Nothing.

06:49.409 --> 06:50.409
Just checking.

06:50.450 --> 06:52.310
There seems to be something wrong

06:52.330 --> 06:53.770
with the drainage system.

06:53.770 --> 06:54.970
You're acting weird.

07:09.930 --> 07:10.880
Can you not go?

07:13.650 --> 07:15.010
I'll only be gone for 3 years.

07:15.010 --> 07:16.120
It'll go by fast.

07:17.970 --> 07:19.010
3 years...

07:21.570 --> 07:22.530
3 years

07:23.530 --> 07:25.280
can change a lot of things,

07:27.520 --> 07:28.720
including you and me.

07:29.890 --> 07:30.970
You and me?

07:31.840 --> 07:33.520
How?

07:33.650 --> 07:34.890
How?

07:35.890 --> 07:37.020
Fine, I'll tell you.

07:38.090 --> 07:39.210
For these three years,

07:39.210 --> 07:40.530
you'll be abroad all alone.

07:40.530 --> 07:44.460
If you get sick, without me by your side,
who's going to take care of you?

07:44.720 --> 07:46.010
I'll be here all alone.

07:46.010 --> 07:47.530
If I get sick, without you by my side,

07:47.530 --> 07:48.860
what am I supposed to do?

07:50.450 --> 07:51.650
Don't give me

07:52.409 --> 07:53.090
that long-distance relationship talk.

07:53.090 --> 07:55.770
Don't tell me we can still be together
by texting, calling,

07:55.770 --> 07:57.010
and video chatting every day.

07:57.010 --> 07:57.570
Let me tell you.

07:57.570 --> 07:58.650
I don't need that!

07:58.720 --> 07:59.530
And I don't believe in it!

07:59.530 --> 08:02.450
All I need is you by my side!
Understand?

08:06.450 --> 08:08.250
Then you go abroad with me, okay?

08:09.210 --> 08:10.120
Go with you?

08:12.590 --> 08:13.910
How can I go with you?

08:14.890 --> 08:16.280
I've bought a house here.

08:16.280 --> 08:17.970
My studio is here.

08:17.970 --> 08:19.530
All my best friends are here.

08:19.530 --> 08:20.410
How can I go with you?

08:20.410 --> 08:21.650
What would I even do there?

08:21.650 --> 08:22.530
What would I do?

08:22.530 --> 08:24.120
Just be your plus-one?

08:24.630 --> 08:25.210
I'm tell you

08:25.210 --> 08:26.330
I can't do it.

08:34.880 --> 08:35.880
I get it.

08:38.850 --> 08:39.520
So,

08:40.400 --> 08:41.210
you

08:43.120 --> 08:44.090
never actually

08:46.640 --> 08:49.000
thought about our future, did you?

08:56.090 --> 08:56.810
It's fine.

09:08.450 --> 09:09.210
Good.

09:09.870 --> 09:11.450
Then I wish you the best of luck

09:11.450 --> 09:12.780
with your application.

09:17.690 --> 09:19.550
I have things to do. I'm going now.

09:19.690 --> 09:21.150
What's wrong with you now?

09:21.850 --> 09:22.850
Nothing.

09:23.480 --> 09:25.970
I just don't want to be with someone
who has no future with me.

09:25.970 --> 09:26.770
Is that wrong?

09:30.240 --> 09:31.500
Let's leave it at that.

09:38.850 --> 09:39.720
Little Champion,

09:39.720 --> 09:41.050
have you been waiting long?

09:41.050 --> 09:42.720
You're finally here.

09:44.720 --> 09:45.600
Listen,

09:45.620 --> 09:47.970
I was really happy today.

09:47.970 --> 09:50.360
Do you remember that gig at the café
back in high school?

09:50.360 --> 09:52.330
It felt exactly the same.

09:52.330 --> 09:53.570
Of course I remember.

09:53.850 --> 09:54.970
I've got good news too.

09:54.970 --> 09:55.480
Yeah.

09:56.450 --> 09:58.330
Today, my first day of internship

09:58.330 --> 09:59.900
went really well.

10:01.970 --> 10:03.600
Do you still have to practice today?

10:03.600 --> 10:04.480
No.

10:04.480 --> 10:05.480
Let's go celebrate.

10:05.480 --> 10:06.330
What do you say?

10:06.330 --> 10:07.050
Then,

10:07.690 --> 10:09.020
how are we celebrating?

10:10.240 --> 10:11.840
We'll eat whatever you want.

10:13.850 --> 10:15.450
Did your stomach just growl?

10:28.600 --> 10:30.210
When you were playing just now,

10:30.210 --> 10:30.970
I noticed

10:30.970 --> 10:33.810
your wound kept flashing before my eyes.

10:34.330 --> 10:35.090
To be honest,

10:35.720 --> 10:36.970
I was really worried.

10:37.450 --> 10:38.210
Thanks.

10:38.570 --> 10:40.640
I didn't even notice when I got hurt.

10:42.330 --> 10:43.170
Looks like

10:43.170 --> 10:44.240
we're both free.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.760
How about we have a drink?

10:45.930 --> 10:47.810
I'm not feeling well today.

10:47.930 --> 10:49.060
Maybe another time.

10:49.600 --> 10:50.170
Well,

10:50.190 --> 10:50.970
I'll get going then.

10:50.970 --> 10:51.480
Yu.

10:52.120 --> 10:53.000
I wanted to ask

10:53.240 --> 10:55.360
about Mr. Guo, whom we met last time.

10:55.600 --> 10:56.900
What are his conditions

10:56.900 --> 10:58.700
for sponsoring music students?

11:00.860 --> 11:01.740
Well,

11:03.690 --> 11:04.540
I'm not really

11:04.600 --> 11:05.570
sure about that.

11:05.840 --> 11:06.700
How about this?

11:06.720 --> 11:07.930
I'll put in a good word for you,

11:07.930 --> 11:08.790
ask him nicely,

11:08.930 --> 11:11.590
and see
if he'll fully fund your studies abroad.

11:14.050 --> 11:14.720
You

11:14.720 --> 11:15.720
don't have to feel pressured.

11:15.720 --> 11:17.520
Take your time to think about it.

11:18.150 --> 11:18.850
You know,

11:18.850 --> 11:19.600
our circle

11:19.600 --> 11:21.450
values educational background

11:21.570 --> 11:23.030
and experience very much.

11:25.930 --> 11:26.330
Yeah.

11:26.810 --> 11:27.450
Thank you.

11:30.450 --> 11:30.930
Ning.

11:31.090 --> 11:32.050
How about this?

11:32.450 --> 11:33.790
I'm pretty close

11:33.820 --> 11:34.970
with Mr. Guo.

11:35.070 --> 11:36.680
I'll ask him out,

11:36.710 --> 11:38.360
and we can have a good talk with him

11:38.360 --> 11:40.610
about how to generate revenue for him.

11:41.720 --> 11:43.360
After all, they are businessmen.

11:43.360 --> 11:44.450
Without profit,

11:44.830 --> 11:47.110
he won't just sponsor you to go abroad
for nothing.

11:47.110 --> 11:47.950
Right?

11:49.090 --> 11:49.570
Yeah.

11:50.090 --> 11:50.950
How about this?

11:51.210 --> 11:51.820
Yu.

11:51.970 --> 11:54.370
Next time you meet Mr. Guo,
take me with you.

11:54.480 --> 11:55.490
I'll do my best

11:55.520 --> 11:58.330
to help you secure the investment
for the orchestra.

11:58.330 --> 11:59.720
And I would really appreciate it

11:59.720 --> 12:01.380
if you put in a good word for me.

12:04.380 --> 12:04.880
Okay.

12:05.090 --> 12:06.330
Wait for my news.

12:08.720 --> 12:09.180
I'm off.

12:09.850 --> 12:10.330
Bye.

12:23.980 --> 12:26.920
So this Ma is quite a character.

12:27.320 --> 12:29.410
Your job sounds pretty fun.

12:29.930 --> 12:31.090
It really is fun.

12:31.090 --> 12:33.530
My head is still spinning from his punch.

12:33.850 --> 12:34.690
Spinning?

12:34.690 --> 12:35.450
Let me see.

12:35.570 --> 12:36.360
Here?

12:36.380 --> 12:37.010
Yeah.

12:37.360 --> 12:38.970
There's a big bump!

12:38.970 --> 12:39.970
Then blow on it.

12:41.210 --> 12:41.720
Better?

12:43.480 --> 12:44.470
The bump is gone.

12:44.850 --> 12:46.030
Wow, magic.

12:49.930 --> 12:51.600
Do you know what I was thinking

12:51.600 --> 12:52.810
while I was playing today?

12:52.810 --> 12:54.140
What were you thinking?

12:54.750 --> 12:55.480
Let me guess.

12:56.360 --> 12:57.690
Were you thinking

12:58.570 --> 13:00.850
about how amazing you actually played?

13:00.850 --> 13:02.450
Was my playing not good?

13:02.590 --> 13:03.920
Your playing was great.

13:04.450 --> 13:07.090
Actually, when the semester started,

13:07.170 --> 13:09.640
there were so many talented people around.

13:09.850 --> 13:12.570
Even though I passed
Professor Ye's audition,

13:12.990 --> 13:14.600
I still felt like I wasn't good enough.

13:14.600 --> 13:15.450
And now?

13:16.330 --> 13:17.760
Now I feel

13:18.450 --> 13:20.380
that at least I'm chasing my dream.

13:20.450 --> 13:21.870
At least I can

13:21.970 --> 13:22.810
feel

13:23.330 --> 13:25.540
and even enjoy every single moment.

13:26.050 --> 13:27.250
That's enough for me.

13:27.970 --> 13:29.950
Actually, in this world,

13:30.240 --> 13:31.240
there are

13:31.600 --> 13:33.050
so many people

13:33.330 --> 13:35.930
working harder and struggling harder
than us.

13:36.850 --> 13:37.570
So,

13:38.330 --> 13:39.570
we're already doing great.

13:39.570 --> 13:40.170
Yeah.

13:42.360 --> 13:42.970
To dreams.

13:43.170 --> 13:44.090
To our dreams.

13:44.280 --> 13:44.720
To

13:44.850 --> 13:46.330
our future.

13:51.810 --> 13:52.740
I almost forgot.

13:53.090 --> 13:53.800
What?

13:53.970 --> 13:55.700
The 100-day anniversary gift.

13:56.330 --> 13:57.810
100-day anniversary?

13:57.810 --> 13:59.570
I thought it was still a few days away.

13:59.570 --> 14:01.720
I counted from the day we kissed.

14:02.450 --> 14:05.510
Shouldn't we count
from the day I confessed?

14:05.810 --> 14:07.360
Just take it.

14:08.570 --> 14:09.210
So,

14:09.850 --> 14:10.640
what is this?

14:11.450 --> 14:12.720
This is

14:12.720 --> 14:13.560
our

14:13.690 --> 14:14.850
love notebook.

14:15.170 --> 14:16.330
Our love notebook?

14:16.720 --> 14:18.330
One is for you, and the other is for me.

14:18.330 --> 14:20.820
If you have something
you want to say to me

14:20.930 --> 14:23.330
but are too shy to say it,

14:23.480 --> 14:24.940
just write it down in here.

14:26.570 --> 14:27.690
Sounds romantic.

14:27.690 --> 14:29.090
But how do I give it to you?

14:29.450 --> 14:30.570
Leave it

14:30.720 --> 14:32.050
under the tree

14:32.690 --> 14:33.890
where you confessed.

14:34.850 --> 14:36.740
This feels just like a movie.

14:37.530 --> 14:42.060
At such an epic moment, shouldn't we...

14:59.210 --> 15:00.170
Tell me,

15:01.310 --> 15:02.910
what's the difference

15:03.830 --> 15:05.490
between friendship and love?

15:06.030 --> 15:07.330
Right now, it seems

15:07.720 --> 15:09.770
that except for kissing,

15:10.360 --> 15:12.090
nothing's changed between us.

15:15.720 --> 15:16.690
It's okay.

15:16.710 --> 15:18.270
We still have plenty of time

15:18.300 --> 15:19.560
to figure that out.

15:19.840 --> 15:20.520
Right?

15:24.260 --> 15:25.660
Then let's take our time!

15:31.120 --> 15:32.480
The thing between you and Ningn

15:32.480 --> 15:33.330
is over?

15:33.480 --> 15:34.050
Yeah.

15:34.330 --> 15:35.690
It caused such a scene,

15:35.690 --> 15:37.220
and you didn't even tell me.

15:38.560 --> 15:39.810
It wasn't a big deal.

15:40.930 --> 15:42.050
But I heard

15:42.050 --> 15:43.850
you passed Professor Ye's audition.

15:43.850 --> 15:44.240
Yeah.

15:45.970 --> 15:46.770
That's right.

15:47.210 --> 15:49.540
I attend Professor Ye's class every week.

15:51.090 --> 15:54.000
But Professor Ye said something to me.

15:54.030 --> 15:55.450
I didn't quite get it.

15:55.450 --> 15:56.170
What was it?

15:56.720 --> 15:57.720
Professor Ye said

15:57.720 --> 15:58.970
people in love

15:59.170 --> 16:00.530
could still break up.

16:00.570 --> 16:02.600
Why would people in love break up?

16:02.810 --> 16:03.850
I don't know.

16:04.210 --> 16:05.480
Why?

16:07.480 --> 16:08.400
Why?

16:09.170 --> 16:09.720
Shan.

16:10.150 --> 16:11.060
Why?

16:11.360 --> 16:13.210
Why do people in love break up?

16:14.480 --> 16:15.450
You don't get it.

16:15.970 --> 16:17.370
Let me ask you something.

16:17.480 --> 16:18.970
If you went abroad,

16:19.210 --> 16:20.590
what about Tong Xiaole?

16:21.450 --> 16:22.600
I could come back.

16:23.330 --> 16:25.330
What if you didn't want to come back?

16:25.760 --> 16:27.060
He could go abroad.

16:27.360 --> 16:29.430
What if he didn't want to go abroad?

16:29.720 --> 16:31.710
I really could come back.

16:31.850 --> 16:32.330
Then...

16:35.690 --> 16:36.050
No.

16:37.360 --> 16:39.050
If you didn't want to come back,

16:39.050 --> 16:40.330
and he didn't want to go abroad,

16:40.330 --> 16:41.330
what would you do?

16:44.450 --> 16:45.380
What would we do?

16:46.210 --> 16:47.240
What would they do?

16:47.240 --> 16:48.090
What would they do?

16:48.090 --> 16:49.210
Break up!

16:49.570 --> 16:50.970
That's the thing
about long-distance relationships.

16:50.970 --> 16:52.570
So people who love each other
can still break up.

16:52.570 --> 16:53.330
Get it?

16:54.360 --> 16:56.050
Long-distance relationships, huh?

16:56.050 --> 16:57.840
People all face
birth, aging, sickness, and death.

16:57.840 --> 17:00.490
Separation by life and death is also
a kind of long-distance relationship.

17:00.490 --> 17:02.570
If one day my beloved
will eventually leave the world,

17:02.570 --> 17:04.900
does that mean
I shouldn't be with him now?

17:13.089 --> 17:13.960
Well,

17:14.089 --> 17:15.680
wait a second.

17:17.680 --> 17:18.849
What you're saying

17:18.849 --> 17:20.050
is just a hypothetical.

17:20.050 --> 17:21.680
I'm talking about the situation
when we're alive, which is different.

17:21.680 --> 17:23.810
What you're saying is also a hypothetical.

17:23.810 --> 17:25.440
Who can predict the future?

17:25.770 --> 17:26.490
So,

17:26.730 --> 17:28.190
if you love each other now,

17:28.490 --> 17:29.220
you should be

17:29.290 --> 17:30.730
together right now!

17:50.780 --> 17:54.290
♪ The story begins with hand in hand ♪

17:55.530 --> 17:57.490
♪ For no reason at all ♪

17:57.810 --> 18:00.350
♪ I just want to walk with you ♪

18:01.650 --> 18:05.490
♪ Simply until we grow old ♪

18:06.620 --> 18:10.420
♪ Every warm touch that drew us closer ♪

18:08.830 --> 18:10.200
What do you mean?

18:10.730 --> 18:11.960
Let's not see each other anymore.

18:11.070 --> 18:13.060
♪ Was nothing but a dream ♪

18:13.580 --> 18:16.950
♪ So many sunrises and sunsets ♪

18:17.290 --> 18:21.090
♪ Have changed our original hearts ♪

18:21.850 --> 18:24.940
♪ By not thinking about it or guessing ♪

18:25.320 --> 18:28.270
♪ I thought I could break free ♪

18:28.440 --> 18:34.760
♪ Time has shown
I'm not as carefree as I imagined ♪

18:37.020 --> 18:40.980
♪ I still can't forget the tenderness
you gave me that year ♪

18:41.060 --> 18:44.720
♪ Exhausting all my strength,
I still can't fool myself ♪

18:45.090 --> 18:48.250
♪ Your place is still here ♪

18:48.400 --> 18:52.200
♪ No one else can take it ♪

18:53.000 --> 18:56.560
♪ Let me treat it as just a heavy rain ♪

18:56.790 --> 19:01.400
♪ Gradually, the memories we've built
become clear ♪

19:01.560 --> 19:05.930
♪ All composed into a song ♪

19:07.200 --> 19:09.930
♪ It's still so beautiful ♪

19:27.060 --> 19:30.870
♪ Every warm touch that drew us closer ♪

19:31.510 --> 19:33.500
♪ Was nothing but a dream ♪

19:34.020 --> 19:37.420
♪ So many sunrises and sunsets ♪

19:35.770 --> 19:37.170
Why did you want to see me?

19:37.730 --> 19:41.530
♪ Have changed our original hearts ♪

19:42.200 --> 19:45.380
♪ By not thinking about it or guessing ♪

19:45.760 --> 19:48.710
♪ I thought I could break free ♪

19:48.880 --> 19:55.200
♪ Time has shown
I'm not as carefree as I imagined ♪

19:54.050 --> 19:55.830
Don't you hate me?

19:56.650 --> 19:58.450
When did I ever say I hated you?

19:57.460 --> 20:01.420
♪ I still can't forget the tenderness
you gave me that year ♪

20:01.320 --> 20:02.650
Then what do you mean now?

20:01.500 --> 20:05.160
♪ Exhausting all my strength,
I still can't fool myself ♪

20:05.530 --> 20:08.690
♪ Your place is still here ♪

20:08.840 --> 20:12.640
♪ No one else can take it ♪

20:11.290 --> 20:12.690
Let's get back together.

20:13.440 --> 20:17.030
♪ Let me treat it as just a heavy rain ♪

20:17.200 --> 20:21.770
♪ Gradually, the memories we've built
become clear ♪

20:17.490 --> 20:18.750
I'm leaving tomorrow.

20:18.960 --> 20:20.020
Leaving tomorrow?

20:20.440 --> 20:20.960
Yeah.

20:22.000 --> 20:26.320
♪ All composed into a song ♪

20:22.640 --> 20:23.330
Alright.

20:23.730 --> 20:24.990
Then let's be together

20:25.810 --> 20:26.980
until you don't want to anymore.

20:26.820 --> 20:30.500
♪ Hidden deep inside my heart ♪

20:30.780 --> 20:33.140
♪ The one who was my only love ♪

20:31.200 --> 20:32.730
Why did your personality suddenly change?

20:32.730 --> 20:33.530
Do you like it?

20:33.270 --> 20:36.910
♪ Now becomes out of reach ♪

20:37.780 --> 20:43.670
♪ Zooming out to find the trace ♪

20:45.090 --> 20:49.050
♪ I still can't forget the tenderness
you gave me that year ♪

20:48.440 --> 20:51.840
Didn't you say
there is a full moon tonight?

20:49.130 --> 20:52.590
♪ Exhausting all my strength,
I still can't fool myself ♪

20:52.790 --> 20:54.340
So why haven't you transformed?

20:53.010 --> 20:56.090
♪ Your place is still here ♪

20:55.810 --> 20:56.730
Today,

20:57.680 --> 20:59.440
the clouds are thick,
and they're covering the moon.

20:59.440 --> 21:01.170
How am I supposed to transform?

21:02.960 --> 21:04.890
You're right. I don't see the moon.

21:06.730 --> 21:08.920
So this is how we spend
our 100-day anniversary?

21:08.920 --> 21:09.960
Of course not.

21:10.120 --> 21:11.780
The moon will come out in a bit.

21:12.250 --> 21:14.440
You're not just brushing me off, are you?

21:14.440 --> 21:15.810
How is that possible?

21:17.160 --> 21:18.440
I want some boba tea.

21:18.440 --> 21:19.570
I won't give you any.

21:20.880 --> 21:22.120
What are you doing?

21:25.440 --> 21:26.810
What is that?

21:30.880 --> 21:35.010
Who's having a little movie night
on the hill?

21:35.200 --> 21:36.780
Who is it?

21:36.810 --> 21:37.600
Who is it?

21:37.600 --> 21:38.460
Who is it?

21:39.010 --> 21:40.880
Who is so romantic?

21:40.880 --> 21:41.960
It's you, isn't it?

21:42.200 --> 21:43.160
You did this.

21:44.250 --> 21:47.360
Why did you have to call me out?

21:49.010 --> 21:50.770
Then I'm really looking forward

21:50.770 --> 21:52.600
to seeing what you've planned.

21:53.640 --> 21:55.850
Please close your eyes first.

21:59.890 --> 22:01.360
You don't even need to be told,

22:01.360 --> 22:03.160
just turning around on your own.

22:04.730 --> 22:07.600
Don't turn around or peek
until I finish counting down from three.

22:07.600 --> 22:08.200
Okay.

22:12.400 --> 22:13.360
No peeking.

22:21.400 --> 22:21.880
Three.

22:22.200 --> 22:22.530
Two.

22:26.490 --> 22:27.730
Why did you turn around?

22:27.730 --> 22:29.160
Now the surprise is ruined.

22:29.160 --> 22:30.800
♪ All the stars surround you ♪

22:30.820 --> 22:32.490
♪ The moon smiles at you ♪

22:32.520 --> 22:35.660
♪ I give you all the good things
in the world ♪

22:33.250 --> 22:35.520
I did even worse than you!

22:36.310 --> 22:37.780
♪ And the light in your eyes ♪

22:36.490 --> 22:37.880
What should I do?

22:37.820 --> 22:39.860
♪ Shines like diamonds ♪

22:40.190 --> 22:42.960
♪ Drawing an exclamation mark
in my world ♪

22:40.680 --> 22:41.530
Tong Xiaole!

22:41.730 --> 22:42.850
Stop filming.

22:43.040 --> 22:44.550
♪ The evening breeze embraces you ♪

22:44.620 --> 22:46.370
♪ And I run towards you ♪

22:45.640 --> 22:46.590
Don't make me...

22:46.430 --> 22:49.720
♪ I hear our passionate heartbeats ♪

22:49.940 --> 22:51.340
♪ We borrow a dream ♪

22:51.360 --> 22:53.550
♪ To build a castle ♪

22:52.250 --> 22:52.730
Yi Lan.

22:53.970 --> 22:56.300
♪ Every star is a romantic symbol ♪

22:54.970 --> 22:55.550
Yi Lan.

22:56.350 --> 22:58.730
♪ Let me find you ♪

22:56.640 --> 22:57.900
You're still filming?

22:59.960 --> 23:01.960
I look so silly in the film.

23:02.160 --> 23:03.620
I think you look cute in it.

23:04.120 --> 23:06.540
I was so chubby back then.

23:06.680 --> 23:09.200
Chubby? You were cute as a button.

23:11.140 --> 23:13.990
♪ Even mountains and seas
can't separate us ♪

23:14.680 --> 23:17.730
♪ I wish I could turn into a bird
to explore the world for you ♪

23:18.130 --> 23:19.680
♪ The vast, boundless Milky Way ♪

23:19.700 --> 23:21.430
♪ Sings its tender serenade ♪

23:21.540 --> 23:23.770
♪ I can't live a second without you ♪

23:23.680 --> 23:24.960
Come over here!

23:25.060 --> 23:28.330
♪ Looking forward
to the next beautiful dream ♪

23:26.490 --> 23:27.990
What are you doing?

23:28.410 --> 23:29.790
♪ I just want to be with you ♪

23:28.730 --> 23:29.770
Let's wave.

23:30.020 --> 23:33.010
♪ To see the most romantic starry sky
together ♪

23:33.250 --> 23:35.530
Tong Xiaole, what are you doing?
Come over here.

23:33.360 --> 23:37.430
♪ The evening breeze tells
heartfelt emotions ♪

23:38.300 --> 23:39.940
♪ All the stars surround you ♪

23:39.960 --> 23:41.630
♪ The moon smiles at you ♪

23:41.660 --> 23:44.730
♪ I give you all the good things
in the world ♪

23:45.270 --> 23:46.830
♪ And the light in your eyes ♪

23:46.490 --> 23:48.120
I remember it was

23:46.900 --> 23:48.970
♪ Shines like diamonds ♪

23:48.200 --> 23:49.360
right before the college entrance exam.

23:49.270 --> 23:52.040
♪ Drawing an exclamation mark
in my world ♪

23:52.160 --> 23:53.680
♪ The evening breeze embraces you ♪

23:53.700 --> 23:55.450
♪ And I run towards you ♪

23:55.510 --> 23:58.800
♪ I hear our passionate heartbeats ♪

23:55.920 --> 23:57.050
Does this look good or...

23:57.050 --> 23:58.360
In the small garden...

23:58.360 --> 23:58.960
Let's all...

23:58.960 --> 24:00.440
We dig here and there.

23:59.020 --> 24:00.480
♪ We borrow a dream ♪

24:00.510 --> 24:02.600
♪ To build a castle ♪

24:01.640 --> 24:02.960
Tong Xiaole, what are you doing?

24:02.960 --> 24:05.380
♪ Every star is a romantic symbol ♪

24:03.160 --> 24:04.010
Are you in?

24:04.440 --> 24:05.530
Join us!

24:05.430 --> 24:07.870
♪ Let me find you ♪

24:06.960 --> 24:07.960
You're so boring.

24:09.620 --> 24:11.080
♪ All the stars surround you ♪

24:11.120 --> 24:12.790
♪ The moon smiles at you ♪

24:12.820 --> 24:15.950
♪ I give you all the good things
in the world ♪

24:16.430 --> 24:18.000
♪ And the light in your eyes ♪

24:18.060 --> 24:20.140
♪ Shines like diamonds ♪

24:18.200 --> 24:19.200
Come over here!

24:19.920 --> 24:21.250
What are you filming here?

24:20.430 --> 24:23.200
♪ Drawing an exclamation mark
in my world ♪

24:21.250 --> 24:23.580
Come over here!

24:23.320 --> 24:24.840
♪ The evening breeze embraces you ♪

24:24.250 --> 24:24.960
Do you like it?

24:24.860 --> 24:26.610
♪ And I run towards you ♪

24:25.440 --> 24:26.810
I love it!

24:26.670 --> 24:29.960
♪ I hear our passionate heartbeats ♪

24:27.290 --> 24:28.360
But it's not fair.

24:29.250 --> 24:30.290
In comparison,

24:30.180 --> 24:31.650
♪ We borrow a dream ♪

24:30.290 --> 24:33.400
my gift seems

24:31.670 --> 24:33.760
♪ To build a castle ♪

24:33.950 --> 24:35.250
less thoughtful than yours.

24:34.120 --> 24:36.540
♪ Every star is a romantic symbol ♪

24:36.590 --> 24:39.030
♪ Let me find you ♪

24:36.880 --> 24:39.120
I really like your love notebook too.

24:39.250 --> 24:40.200
Besides,

24:40.440 --> 24:41.640
I'm with you.

24:41.880 --> 24:43.680
You're the best gift for me.

24:44.400 --> 24:45.920
Really?

24:46.120 --> 24:46.730
Really.

24:49.490 --> 24:51.440
Can I drink your boba tea now?

25:06.730 --> 25:09.920
I heard your late husband
sponsored hundreds of students.

25:09.920 --> 25:11.010
But we know

25:11.340 --> 25:13.940
you didn't really support him
in that at first.

25:14.340 --> 25:16.870
So why did you keep doing this
after he passed?

25:16.960 --> 25:18.210
You know,

25:18.440 --> 25:21.880
people sometimes live
just to prove their worth.

25:22.290 --> 25:23.250
Since he said

25:23.290 --> 25:24.950
he would help these students,

25:24.960 --> 25:26.440
these children,

25:26.600 --> 25:27.930
I have to see it through,

25:28.120 --> 25:28.810
making sure

25:28.920 --> 25:30.290
he still lives on

25:30.730 --> 25:32.330
in these children's hearts.

25:36.810 --> 25:37.490
Ma.

25:38.600 --> 25:40.360
Sorry, I didn't mean to.

25:41.640 --> 25:42.860
I...

25:43.200 --> 25:44.160
I'm sorry, Ma.

25:44.920 --> 25:45.780
How about this?

25:46.200 --> 25:46.930
I just bought

25:47.250 --> 25:48.770
a new thermos.

25:49.160 --> 25:50.690
You can use it for now, okay?

25:52.290 --> 25:53.330
You brat.

25:54.050 --> 25:55.290
I'm telling you

25:55.530 --> 25:58.090
I never accept any bribes.

26:00.920 --> 26:02.380
But this is compensation.

26:02.530 --> 26:03.810
So I'll take it.

26:05.160 --> 26:05.560
Right.

26:05.810 --> 26:06.400
Compensation.

26:06.400 --> 26:07.050
Sit down.

26:07.070 --> 26:07.440
Let's talk.

26:07.440 --> 26:07.730
Ma.

26:07.960 --> 26:09.600
How are the photos I took today?

26:09.600 --> 26:11.600
The photos are not bad,

26:11.880 --> 26:12.770
but

26:12.920 --> 26:14.360
our interview

26:14.530 --> 26:15.520
isn't just

26:15.880 --> 26:17.810
about asking questions and recording.

26:17.810 --> 26:19.320
It's about truly

26:19.440 --> 26:21.200
feeling and conveying

26:21.440 --> 26:23.360
the emotions behind the story.

26:24.200 --> 26:24.880
Got it?

26:26.250 --> 26:26.730
Yeah.

26:27.730 --> 26:28.590
One more thing.

26:28.730 --> 26:30.390
The editor-in-chief is back tomorrow.

26:30.390 --> 26:33.290
You've always been interested
in the overseas beat, right?

26:33.290 --> 26:34.950
I'll introduce you tomorrow.

26:35.160 --> 26:37.020
But tomorrow is your only chance.

26:37.670 --> 26:38.430
Really?

26:40.730 --> 26:41.730
Ma, I got it.

26:41.770 --> 26:43.290
I'll definitely be well prepared.

26:43.290 --> 26:44.010
Thanks, Ma.

26:54.250 --> 26:55.120
Xi.

26:56.680 --> 26:57.440
Xi.

27:03.150 --> 27:04.080
Xi.

27:06.290 --> 27:07.280
Xiaoyi.

27:11.810 --> 27:13.210
My stomach really hurts.

27:13.640 --> 27:14.920
Can you help...

27:15.490 --> 27:16.490
Got it.
